2182  SAM0_01_KOR, SAM0_02_CHN, SAM0_03_JPN, SAM0_04_RUS, SAM0_05_MNG, SAM0_06_PRK,
2183  SAM0_07_NAM, SAM0_08_LAM, SAM0_09_WEU, SAM0_10_EEU, SAM0_11_FSU, SAM0_12_MEA,
2184  SAM0_13_AFR, SAM0_14_CPA, SAM0_15_SAS, SAM0_16_PAS, SAM0_17_PAO
